1
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Everything that has a beginning has an end.

2
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
The Matrix Revolutions is a adventure, action,
thriller film directed by Lilly Wachowski.

3
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:27,000
The human city of Zion defends itself against the massive invasion of the machines as Neo
fights to end the war at another front while also opposing the rogue Agent Smith.

4
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Neo, played by Keanu Reeves.

5
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:21,000
Morpheus, played by Laurence Fishburne.

6
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Trinity, played by Carrie-Anne Moss.

7
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:15,000
Agent Smith, played by Hugo Weaving.

8
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:42,000
Niobe, played by Jada Pinkett Smith.

9
00:58:03,000 --> 00:58:09,000
The Oracle, played by Mary Alice.

10
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
The Matrix Revolutions is a 2003 American science fiction
action film written and directed by the Wachowskis.

11
01:10:57,000 --> 01:11:03,000
It is the third in The Matrix film series, released
six months after the second film.

12
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:30,000
It stars Keanu Reeves, Laurence Fishburne, Carrie-Anne
Moss, Hugo Weaving and Jada Pinkett Smith.

13
01:23:51,000 --> 01:23:57,000
The plot involves Neo and his allies as they fight to end the war between humanity
and the machines permanently while opposing the rogue Agent Smith.

14
01:30:18,000 --> 01:30:24,000
The Matrix Revolutions was released worldwide on
November 5, 2003, by Warner Bros.

15
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:51,000
It was the first live-action feature film to be released in
both regular and IMAX theaters simultaneously.

16
01:43:12,000 --> 01:43:18,000
It grossed $427 million, becoming the eighth-highest-grossing film
of 2003, and received mixed reviews from critics.

17
01:49:39,000 --> 01:49:45,000
A fourth film, The Matrix Resurrections, was released in 2021.

18
01:56:06,000 --> 01:56:12,000
The film explores themes of dying and death,
rescue, future, mission, man vs machine.

19
02:02:33,000 --> 02:02:39,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
